  "title": "Vanilla Spice Bread",
  "description": "A slightly sweet loaf of bread with subtle flavors of vanilla, coriander, and cardamom is made with the dough cycle of a bread machine but baked in the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "sclmlw"
  ],
